    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110-a1">

                <pb facs="0283" n="1243" sameAs="frus:frus1888p2/pg1243"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 188.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Mariscal to Mr.
                            Whitehouse.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1888-11-15"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 15,
                        1888</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chargé d’Affaires</hi>: In a telegram dated
                    yesterday the governor of the State of Coahuila informs me:</p>
                <p>“I delayed replying to your telegram of the 10th instant in order to secure
                    necessary <pb facs="0284" n="1244" xml:id="pg1244"/> information. Mr. Rankin has
                    not appeared with documents setting forth the crime of the prisoners Shields and
                    Wilson, nor has this (State) government received from the authorities of Texas
                    any requisition for the extradition of the men.”</p>
                <p>Which I have the honor to inform you; renewing, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ignacio Mariscal.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
